    "en": "Both A and R are true, but R is not the correct explanation of A."
   },
   {
    "en": "A is true, but R is false."
   },
   {
    "en": "A is false, but R is true."
   }
  ],
  "answer": 3,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "The total energy ½kA² is the same at every point; only its division between KE and PE changes. A is false. KE is maximum at the mean position, so R is true."
  },
